(360, 8, NULL, 'FAT_GRAFTING', 5, '40s', 'F', 'KR', 'ko', '신사에서 지방이식 받았어요. 원장님이 원하는 스타일을 꼼꼼하게 물어봐 주셨어요. 대기 시간이 짧아서 좋았어요. 다음에도 재방문 의사 있어요.', '2026-09-22T14:35:00+09:00'),
(361, 8, NULL, 'DOUBLE_EYELID_INCISION', 4, '30s', 'F', 'US', 'en', 'A friend recommended this place for Incisional Double Eyelid. The doctor took time to understand the look I wanted. Less pain than I expected, and the swelling went down quickly. The interpreter was very helpful. I''d recommend it to friends visiting Seoul.', '2026-02-09T10:16:00+09:00'),
(362, 8, NULL, 'PTOSIS_CORRECTION', 5, '20s', 'F', 'TW', 'zh', '在新沙做了眼睑下垂矫正。效果很自然，非常满意。咨询师讲解得很耐心。推荐给来首尔的朋友。', '2026-09-21T11:07:00+09:00'),
