(371, 8, NULL, 'LIPOSUCTION', 4, '20s', 'F', 'AU', 'en', 'I did my Liposuction consultation and treatment at this clinic. The result looks natural and I''m very happy with it. Aftercare instructions were detailed. Would definitely come back.', '2026-07-12T19:34:00+09:00'),
