(2501, 2, NULL, 'LIP_FILLER', 2, '20s', 'M', 'GB', 'en', 'A friend recommended this place for Lip Filler. The result was not what I expected. Swelling lasted longer than I was told. I waited a long time past my appointment. Compare a few clinics before booking.', '2026-09-24T11:27:00+09:00'),
