(7296, 41, NULL, 'BREAST_AUGMENTATION', 4, '50s', 'F', 'SG', 'en', 'I did my Breast Augmentation consultation and treatment at this clinic. Less pain than I expected, and the swelling went down quickly. The result looks natural and I''m very happy with it. The interpreter was very helpful. I''d recommend it to friends visiting Seoul.', '2026-09-10T15:49:00+09:00'),
(7297, 41, NULL, 'JAW_BOTOX', 4, '30s', 'F', 'SG', 'en', 'I did my Jaw (Masseter) Botox consultation and treatment at this clinic. The doctor took time to understand the look I wanted. The result looks natural and I''m very happy with it. Aftercare instructions were detailed. Would definitely come back.', '2026-08-19T19:32:00+09:00'),
(7298, 41, NULL, 'BREAST_AUGMENTATION', 2, '20s', 'F', 'KR', 'ko', '강남에서 가슴성형 받았어요. 붓기가 생각보다 오래갔어요. 기대했던 결과와 달라서 아쉬워요. 상담이 조금 급하게 진행된 느낌이었어요. 재방문은 고민 중입니다.', '2026-09-20T17:08:00+09:00'),
(7299, 41, NULL, 'DOUBLE_EYELID_NONINCISION', 3, '40s', 'F', 'KR', 'ko', '매몰법 쌍꺼풀 상담부터 시술까지 이곳에서 했습니다. 결과는 무난한 편이에요. 효과가 기대만큼 크진 않았지만 나쁘지 않아요. 대기 시간이 조금 길었어요. 가격 대비 괜찮은 편입니다.', '2026-04-30T10:46:00+09:00'),
