(212, 71, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Jaw (Masseter) Botox consultation to the treatment. The result is natural and I''m very satisfied. The doctor listened carefully to the design I wanted. Having an interpreter there put me at ease. I''d like to recommend it to friends too.', '2026-01-14T10:35:00+09:00'),
(213, 71, 'zh', '瘦脸针从咨询到治疗都交给了这家。效果自然，非常满意。医生很仔细地听取了我想要的设计。有翻译人员在，很安心。也想推荐给朋友。', '2026-01-14T10:35:00+09:00'),
(214, 72, 'ko', '강남에서 이마 보톡스 받았어요. 생각보다 아프지 않았고 붓기도 빨리 빠졌어요. 결과가 아주 자연스러워서 매우 만족해요. 상담사분이 인내심 있게 설명해 주셨어요. 다음에 또 올 거예요.', '2026-08-09T21:52:00+09:00'),
(215, 72, 'en', 'I got Forehead Botox in Gangnam. It hurt less than I imagined, and the swelling went down quickly. The result is very natural and I''m very satisfied. The counselor explained things patiently. I''ll come again next time.', '2026-08-09T21:52:00+09:00'),
(216, 72, 'ja', '江南で額ボトックスを受けました。想像より痛くなく、腫れもすぐに引きました。仕上がりがとても自然で、大満足です。カウンセラーの方が根気よく説明してくれました。次回もまた来ます。', '2026-08-09T21:52:00+09:00'),
(217, 73, 'en', 'I came on a friend''s recommendation and got Jaw (Masseter) Botox. The result is fairly okay. The consultation was fine. It''s decent for the price.', '2026-09-24T13:12:00+09:00'),
