(221, 74, 'en', 'I got Forehead Botox in Gangnam. The result is natural and I''m very satisfied. The doctor listened carefully to the design I wanted. The staff''s explanations were easy to understand. I''d like to use this clinic again.', '2026-09-02T17:50:00+09:00'),
(222, 74, 'zh', '在江南做了额头肉毒素。效果自然，非常满意。医生很仔细地听取了我想要的设计。工作人员的说明很容易理解。还想再来。', '2026-09-02T17:50:00+09:00'),
