(311, 104, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Nose Filler consultation to the treatment. The doctor listened carefully to the design I wanted. The result is natural and I''m very satisfied. The staff''s explanations were easy to understand. I''d like to use this clinic again.', '2026-03-27T16:52:00+09:00'),
(312, 104, 'zh', '鼻子玻尿酸从咨询到治疗都交给了这家。医生很仔细地听取了我想要的设计。效果自然，非常满意。工作人员的说明很容易理解。还想再来。', '2026-03-27T16:52:00+09:00'),
