(425, 142, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Ptosis Correction consultation to the treatment. The result is natural and I''m very satisfied. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The staff''s explanations were easy to understand. I''d like to use this clinic again.', '2026-04-16T10:51:00+09:00'),
(426, 142, 'zh', '眼睑下垂矫正从咨询到治疗都交给了这家。效果自然，非常满意。比想象中疼痛少，消肿也很快。工作人员的说明很容易理解。还想再来。', '2026-04-16T10:51:00+09:00'),
(427, 143, 'en', 'I got Fat Grafting in Sinsa. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The doctor carefully asked about the style I wanted. The short waiting time was nice. I''d like to recommend it to people around me.', '2025-12-11T23:26:00+09:00'),
