(662, 221, 'en', 'I had everything from the consultation to Rejuran Healer at this clinic. The result is very natural and I''m very satisfied. The aftercare guidance was detailed. I''ll come again next time.', '2026-03-17T12:43:00+09:00'),
(663, 221, 'ja', 'カウンセリングからリジュランまで、すべてこちらで受けました。仕上がりがとても自然で、大満足です。アフターケアの案内が詳しかったです。次回もまた来ます。', '2026-03-17T12:43:00+09:00'),
(664, 222, 'en', 'I got Thermage FLX in Cheongdam. The effect wasn''t as big as I expected, but it''s not bad. The waiting time was a little long. I''ll try it once more before deciding.', '2026-03-09T14:43:00+09:00'),
