(668, 223, 'en', 'A friend recommended I come here for Rejuran Healer. The effect wasn''t as noticeable as I expected, but it''s not bad. The result is okay, fairly ordinary. Communication went mostly smoothly. I plan to try it once more and see.', '2026-04-27T10:23:00+09:00'),
