(670, 224, 'en', 'I got Forehead Botox in Cheongdam. The result is natural and I''m satisfied. The aftercare guidance was detailed. I''d like to recommend it to people around me.', '2026-01-28T15:35:00+09:00'),
(671, 224, 'zh', '在清潭做了额头肉毒素。效果自然，很满意。术后护理说明很详细。也想推荐给身边的人。', '2026-01-28T15:35:00+09:00'),
