(796, 266, 'ko', '청담에서 입술 필러 받았어요. 생각보다 아프지 않았고 붓기도 빨리 빠졌어요. 통역사분이 전문적이어서 소통에 문제가 없었어요. 서울에 오는 친구들에게 추천해요.', '2025-11-21T12:18:00+09:00'),
(797, 266, 'en', 'I got Lip Filler in Cheongdam. It hurt less than I imagined, and the swelling went down quickly. The interpreter was professional, and communication was no problem. I recommend it to friends coming to Seoul.', '2025-11-21T12:18:00+09:00'),
