(1880, 627, 'en', 'A friend recommended I come here for Lip Filler. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The doctor listened carefully to the design I wanted. The staff''s explanations were easy to understand. I''d like to use this clinic again.', '2026-09-23T23:35:00+09:00'),
(1881, 627, 'zh', '朋友推荐来做嘴唇玻尿酸。比想象中疼痛少，消肿也很快。医生很仔细地听取了我想要的设计。工作人员的说明很容易理解。还想再来。', '2026-09-23T23:35:00+09:00'),
