(3113, 1038, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Rhinoplasty consultation to the treatment. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The doctor listened carefully to the design I wanted. The staff''s explanations were easy to understand. I''d like to use this clinic again.', '2026-06-22T08:01:00+09:00'),
