(4064, 1355, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Jaw (Masseter) Botox consultation to the treatment. I think the result is average. Not as good as I hoped, but not bad. They covered the basics in their explanation. Reasonable for the price.', '2026-06-01T17:06:00+09:00'),
(4065, 1355, 'zh', '瘦脸针从咨询到治疗都交给了这家。我觉得效果比较普通。虽然没有期待的那么好，但也不差。基本的说明都有。以这个价格来说还算合理。', '2026-06-01T17:06:00+09:00'),
