(4081, 1361, 'en', 'I had everything from the Jaw (Masseter) Botox consultation to the treatment here. The result is natural and I''m satisfied. The doctor carefully asked about the style I wanted. The short waiting time was nice. I''d like to recommend it to people around me.', '2025-12-09T12:17:00+09:00'),
