(6517, 2173, 'en', 'I came on a friend''s recommendation and got Lip Filler. The result is natural and I''m satisfied. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The consultation manager explained things kindly. I''d come back again.', '2026-07-27T20:44:00+09:00'),
(6518, 2173, 'zh', '经朋友推荐来这里做了嘴唇玻尿酸。效果自然，很满意。比想象中疼痛少，消肿也很快。咨询室长很亲切地做了说明。下次还愿意再来。', '2026-07-27T20:44:00+09:00'),
