(6683, 2228, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Forehead Botox consultation to the treatment. The result is natural and I''m very satisfied. The doctor listened carefully to the design I wanted. The staff''s explanations were easy to understand. I''d like to use this clinic again.', '2026-09-17T22:18:00+09:00'),
(6684, 2228, 'zh', '额头肉毒素从咨询到治疗都交给了这家。效果自然，非常满意。医生很仔细地听取了我想要的设计。工作人员的说明很容易理解。还想再来。', '2026-09-17T22:18:00+09:00'),
