(6778, 2260, 'en', 'I came on a friend''s recommendation and got Ultherapy. The result is fairly okay. The effect wasn''t as big as I expected, but it''s not bad. The waiting time was a little long. It''s decent for the price.', '2026-09-09T21:01:00+09:00'),
