(7995, 2665, 'zh', '在新沙做了隆胸。比想象中疼痛少，消肿也很快。有翻译人员在，很安心。还想再来。', '2025-11-15T12:40:00+09:00'),
(7996, 2666, 'en', 'I had everything from the Rhinoplasty consultation to the treatment here. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The doctor carefully asked about the style I wanted. The short waiting time was nice. I''d come back again.', '2026-07-13T20:09:00+09:00'),
