(9458, 3153, 'en', 'I had everything from the consultation to Incisional Double Eyelid at this clinic. The doctor asked very carefully about the style I wanted. It hurt less than I imagined, and the swelling went down quickly. The counselor explained things patiently. I recommend it to friends coming to Seoul.', '2025-12-12T18:04:00+09:00'),
