(9541, 3181, 'en', 'I got Ptosis Correction in Sinsa. The doctor carefully asked about the style I wanted. The aftercare guidance was detailed. I''d like to recommend it to people around me.', '2026-10-10T09:17:00+09:00'),
(9542, 3181, 'zh', '在新沙做了眼睑下垂矫正。院长仔细询问了我想要的风格。术后护理说明很详细。也想推荐给身边的人。', '2026-10-10T09:17:00+09:00'),
