(9544, 3182, 'en', 'I came on a friend''s recommendation and got Jaw (Masseter) Botox. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The result is natural and I''m satisfied. The consultation manager explained things kindly. I''d come back again.', '2025-12-26T12:04:00+09:00'),
