(9641, 3214, 'en', 'I had everything from the consultation to Ptosis Correction at this clinic. The doctor asked very carefully about the style I wanted. The result is very natural and I''m very satisfied. The interpreter was professional, and communication was no problem. I recommend it to friends coming to Seoul.', '2026-03-07T14:41:00+09:00'),
