(9764, 3255, 'en', 'A friend recommended I come here for Shurink (HIFU). It''s a shame the result differed from what I had in mind. The swelling lasted longer than I was told. The consultation was a little hurried. I''m undecided about coming back.', '2026-08-07T08:51:00+09:00'),
