(10001, 3334, 'en', 'A friend recommended I come here for Forehead Botox. The doctor listened carefully to the design I wanted. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. Having an interpreter there put me at ease. I''d like to use this clinic again.', '2026-10-07T23:00:00+09:00'),
