(10583, 3528, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Ultherapy consultation to the treatment. The result is natural and I''m very satisfied. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The aftercare guidance was thorough. I''d like to use this clinic again.', '2026-01-04T21:48:00+09:00'),
