(10837, 3613, 'en', 'I had everything from the Thermage FLX consultation to the treatment here. The result is natural and I''m satisfied. The doctor carefully asked about the style I wanted. The short waiting time was nice. I''d like to recommend it to people around me.', '2026-06-25T08:22:00+09:00'),
