(11219, 3740, 'en', 'I got Forehead Botox in Gangnam. The doctor asked very carefully about the style I wanted. It hurt less than I imagined, and the swelling went down quickly. The interpreter was professional, and communication was no problem. I recommend it to friends coming to Seoul.', '2026-05-08T22:56:00+09:00'),
