(11541, 3847, 'ja', '江南で豊胸手術を受けました。院長が希望のスタイルをとても丁寧に聞いてくれました。アフターケアの案内が詳しかったです。ソウルに来る友人におすすめします。', '2026-08-21T20:44:00+09:00'),
(11542, 3848, 'en', 'I had everything from the Breast Augmentation consultation to the treatment here. It''s disappointing that the result was different from what I expected. The swelling lasted longer than I thought. I waited a long time past my appointment. I''m still thinking about whether to come back.', '2025-12-23T19:00:00+09:00'),
