(11783, 3928, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Thermage FLX consultation to the treatment. The doctor listened carefully to the design I wanted. The aftercare guidance was thorough. I''d like to recommend it to friends too.', '2026-01-28T20:49:00+09:00'),
