(12218, 4073, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Incisional Double Eyelid consultation to the treatment. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The doctor listened carefully to the design I wanted. Having an interpreter there put me at ease. I''d like to recommend it to friends too.', '2026-06-16T22:05:00+09:00'),
(12219, 4073, 'zh', '全切双眼皮从咨询到治疗都交给了这家。比想象中疼痛少，消肿也很快。医生很仔细地听取了我想要的设计。有翻译人员在，很安心。也想推荐给朋友。', '2026-06-16T22:05:00+09:00'),
