(12505, 4169, 'en', 'I came on a friend''s recommendation and got Laser Hair Removal. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The consultation manager explained things kindly. I''d like to recommend it to people around me.', '2026-07-13T08:14:00+09:00'),
