(14496, 4832, 'zh', '朋友推荐来做隆胸。效果自然，非常满意。术后护理的说明很细致。还想再来。', '2026-10-03T18:31:00+09:00'),
(14497, 4833, 'en', 'I had everything from the Laser Hair Removal consultation to the treatment here. The result is natural and I''m satisfied. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The aftercare guidance was detailed. I''d come back again.', '2025-12-25T10:42:00+09:00'),
