(14984, 4995, 'en', 'I got Jaw (Masseter) Botox in Sinsa. The swelling lasted longer than I was told. The result was a bit different from what I expected; a little disappointing. The consultation felt a bit rushed. I suggest comparing a few places before deciding.', '2026-07-26T13:42:00+09:00'),
