(15007, 5003, 'en', 'I got Laser Hair Removal in Sinsa. It''s disappointing that the result was different from what I expected. The swelling lasted longer than I thought. I waited a long time past my appointment. I''m still thinking about whether to come back.', '2026-04-05T12:00:00+09:00'),
