(15248, 5083, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Ultherapy consultation to the treatment. The doctor listened carefully to the design I wanted. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. Having an interpreter there put me at ease. I''d like to use this clinic again.', '2025-11-27T11:29:00+09:00'),
