(15416, 5139, 'en', 'A friend recommended I come here for Fat Grafting. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The result is natural and I''m very satisfied. Having an interpreter there put me at ease. I''d like to recommend it to friends too.', '2026-05-14T20:24:00+09:00'),
(15417, 5139, 'zh', '朋友推荐来做自体脂肪移植。比想象中疼痛少，消肿也很快。效果自然，非常满意。有翻译人员在，很安心。也想推荐给朋友。', '2026-05-14T20:24:00+09:00'),
