(15427, 5143, 'en', 'I had everything from the Rhinoplasty consultation to the treatment here. The result is fairly okay. The effect wasn''t as big as I expected, but it''s not bad. The consultation was fine. I''ll try it once more before deciding.', '2026-05-14T08:37:00+09:00'),
