(16352, 5451, 'en', 'A friend recommended I come here for Nose Filler. The result is very natural and I''m very satisfied. It hurt less than I imagined, and the swelling went down quickly. The interpreter was professional, and communication was no problem. I recommend it to friends coming to Seoul.', '2026-03-23T18:03:00+09:00'),
