(16495, 5499, 'en', 'I had everything from the Laser Hair Removal consultation to the treatment here. The result is fairly okay. The consultation was fine. I''ll try it once more before deciding.', '2026-02-06T22:45:00+09:00'),
(16496, 5499, 'zh', '从激光脱毛咨询到治疗都是在这里做的。效果还算可以。咨询还算顺利。打算再做一次再判断。', '2026-02-06T22:45:00+09:00'),
