(16544, 5515, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Laser Hair Removal consultation to the treatment. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The doctor listened carefully to the design I wanted. The staff''s explanations were easy to understand. I''d like to use this clinic again.', '2026-05-14T15:18:00+09:00'),
(16545, 5515, 'zh', '激光脱毛从咨询到治疗都交给了这家。比想象中疼痛少，消肿也很快。医生很仔细地听取了我想要的设计。工作人员的说明很容易理解。还想再来。', '2026-05-14T15:18:00+09:00'),
