(18476, 6159, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Breast Augmentation consultation to the treatment. There was less pain than I thought, and the swelling went down quickly. The result is natural and I''m very satisfied. Having an interpreter there put me at ease. I''d like to recommend it to friends too.', '2026-08-08T19:10:00+09:00'),
(18477, 6159, 'zh', '隆胸从咨询到治疗都交给了这家。比想象中疼痛少，消肿也很快。效果自然，非常满意。有翻译人员在，很安心。也想推荐给朋友。', '2026-08-08T19:10:00+09:00'),
