(22015, 7339, 'en', 'I got Non-incisional Double Eyelid in Gangnam. The result is natural and I''m satisfied. The doctor carefully asked about the style I wanted. The consultation manager explained things kindly. I''d come back again.', '2025-12-10T13:18:00+09:00'),
