(22712, 7571, 'en', 'I got Nose Filler in Gangnam. The effect wasn''t as noticeable as I expected, but it''s not bad. The result is okay, fairly ordinary. The waiting time was a little long. I plan to try it once more and see.', '2025-11-07T12:24:00+09:00'),
