(22852, 7618, 'en', 'I had everything from the Nose Filler consultation to the treatment here. The result is fairly okay. The effect wasn''t as big as I expected, but it''s not bad. The consultation was fine. It''s decent for the price.', '2026-09-12T17:16:00+09:00'),
