(24920, 8307, 'en', 'I had everything from the consultation to Incisional Double Eyelid at this clinic. The result is very natural and I''m very satisfied. The doctor asked very carefully about the style I wanted. The counselor explained things patiently. I''ll come again next time.', '2025-12-04T16:34:00+09:00'),
