(24923, 8308, 'en', 'I had this clinic handle everything from the Facial Contouring consultation to the treatment. The result is natural and I''m very satisfied. The doctor listened carefully to the design I wanted. Having an interpreter there put me at ease. I''d like to recommend it to friends too.', '2026-07-07T18:33:00+09:00'),
(24924, 8308, 'zh', '面部轮廓手术从咨询到治疗都交给了这家。效果自然，非常满意。医生很仔细地听取了我想要的设计。有翻译人员在，很安心。也想推荐给朋友。', '2026-07-07T18:33:00+09:00'),
